  A security-focused, premium palette designed to convey trust, authority,
  and institutional-grade security. Built on three pillars:

  Primary:   Deep Navy (#1A237E family) - Vault-like trust and authority
  Secondary: Warm Gold (#FFB300 family) - Premium distinction and achievement
  Tertiary:  Rich Teal (#00897B family) - Digital security and verification

  Design Principles:
  - Surfaces carry warm ivory undertones for refined legibility
  - Security indicators use intentional, curated status colors
  - Dark theme uses navy-charcoal, never pure black
  - All colors tested for WCAG AA+ contrast compliance
-->
